00:13:36,366 --> 00:13:41,280
The empirical results are staggering, particularly regarding the scaling laws of alignment.

187
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:49,200
The authors conducted a rigorous audit using the standardized WIT-1024 mutual nearest neighbor benchmark.

188
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,560
Okay, and what did they find?

189
00:13:51,118 --> 00:14:00,960
When they trained a text Jepa using good views, meaning entirely independent text descriptions of the exact same image, the sample efficiency was revolutionary.

